# REDESIGN_PLAN.md

# Attar Brand Website - Complete Redesign Plan

Version: 1.0

---

# Goal

Build a premium, modern, luxury perfume & attar ecommerce website that creates trust, increases conversions, and feels like an international fragrance brand.

This is NOT a simple product listing website.

The website should communicate:

- Premium Quality
- Luxury
- Authenticity
- Elegance
- Simplicity
- Fast shopping experience

---

# Design Philosophy

Think of brands like

- Dior
- Tom Ford
- Jo Malone
- Creed
- Ajmal
- Arabian Oud

Mix that luxury feeling with modern ecommerce usability.

Avoid looking like a typical local ecommerce template.

---

# Brand Personality

Elegant

Premium

Luxury

Minimal

Trustworthy

Modern

Arabic inspired

---

# Target Audience

People looking for

- Daily wear attar
- Premium fragrances
- Gift items
- Arabic fragrances
